 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "When should a patient restart an",
   "start": 0.35,
   "end": 2.242
  },
  {
   "text": "already-prescribed pollen spray?",
   "start": 2.242,
   "end": 4.262
  },
  {
   "text": "And if our own alert rule fails to",
   "start": 4.518,
   "end": 6.422
  },
  {
   "text": "beat the forecast, would we say so?",
   "start": 6.422,
   "end": 9.231
  },
  {
   "text": "Open the live demo with zero keys.",
   "start": 9.981,
   "end": 12.546
  },
  {
   "text": "On Valencia's May twenty-eighth replay,",
   "start": 12.872,
   "end": 15.309
  },
  {
   "text": "pollen stays below threshold, so zero reminders fire.",
   "start": 15.461,
   "end": 19.686
  },
  {
   "text": "Switch to Madrid's May eighteenth grass spike:",
   "start": 20.186,
   "end": 22.972
  },
  {
   "text": "deterministic code drafts one hundred eleven",
   "start": 23.123,
   "end": 25.654
  },
  {
   "text": "reminders, and a nurse approves every batch.",
   "start": 25.654,
   "end": 29.032
  },
  {
   "text": "Weather APIs model an",
   "start": 29.782,
   "end": 31.593
  },
  {
   "text": "eleven-kilometre grid;",
   "start": 31.593,
   "end": 33.277
  },
  {
   "text": "people breathe near point traps.",
   "start": 33.277,
   "end": 35.541
  },
  {
   "text": "We checked five years of Open-Meteo",
   "start": 35.541,
   "end": 37.932
  },
  {
   "text": "forecasts against Madrid, Basel, and",
   "start": 37.932,
   "end": 40.928
  },
  {
   "text": "Z\u00fcrich traps \u2014 seven thousand three",
   "start": 40.928,
   "end": 43.366
  },
  {
   "text": "hundred seventy-three city-days.",
   "start": 43.366,
   "end": 45.525
  },
  {
   "text": "Six rules were frozen in the repo before scoring:",
   "start": 46.425,
   "end": 49.559
  },
  {
   "text": "testing day rules P2 against R1,",
   "start": 49.815,
   "end": 52.821
  },
  {
   "text": "and pre-peak onset R2 against P2 and",
   "start": 53.031,
   "end": 56.073
  },
  {
   "text": "climatology across twenty-eight",
   "start": 56.073,
   "end": 58.209
  },
  {
   "text": "seasons \u2014 including missed seasons.",
   "start": 58.209,
   "end": 61.343
  },
  {
   "text": "Across eight hundred sixty-three high-pollen events,",
   "start": 62.093,
   "end": 65.227
  },
  {
   "text": "the API forecast caught forty-one point six percent.",
   "start": 65.297,
   "end": 69.255
  },
  {
   "text": "Our rule caught forty-one point zero.",
   "start": 69.663,
   "end": 72.158
  },
  {
   "text": "It did not beat the API.",
   "start": 72.484,
   "end": 74.55
  },
  {
   "text": "So the app uses the API forecast,",
   "start": 77.6,
   "end": 80.235
  },
  {
   "text": "and our work went into what happens next.",
   "start": 80.34,
   "end": 83.369
  },
  {
   "text": "Code filters who gets a draft,",
   "start": 84.119,
   "end": 86.231
  },
  {
   "text": "and a nurse approves every batch.",
   "start": 86.278,
   "end": 88.565
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirty-four patients without a medicine",
   "start": 88.891,
   "end": 90.957
  },
  {
   "text": "on file are blocked automatically.",
   "start": 90.957,
   "end": 93.592
  },
  {
   "text": "Each draft names only the",
   "start": 93.744,
   "end": 95.276
  },
  {
   "text": "medicine class already on file.",
   "start": 95.276,
   "end": 97.655
  },
  {
   "text": "Not a medical device.",
   "start": 97.865,
   "end": 99.78
  },
  {
   "text": "Honest limits:",
   "start": 100.53,
   "end": 101.655
  },
  {
   "text": "even the API forecast catches only thirteen",
   "start": 101.807,
   "end": 104.698
  },
  {
   "text": "point six percent of Madrid olive spikes.",
   "start": 104.698,
   "end": 107.878
  },
  {
   "text": "Pre-peak lead reflects look-ahead,",
   "start": 108.204,
   "end": 110.816
  },
  {
   "text": "not beating climatology.",
   "start": 111.072,
   "end": 112.929
  },
  {
   "text": "Valencia is never scored.",
   "start": 113.255,
   "end": 115.587
  },
  {
   "text": "We also tested NASA POWER weather",
   "start": 116.337,
   "end": 118.311
  },
  {
   "text": "data on held-out twenty twenty-four",
   "start": 118.311,
   "end": 121.399
  },
  {
   "text": "and twenty twenty-five.",
   "start": 121.399,
   "end": 123.164
  },
  {
   "text": "A fourteen-day early warning from",
   "start": 123.164,
   "end": 125.323
  },
  {
   "text": "NASA temperatures landed in the",
   "start": 125.323,
   "end": 127.274
  },
  {
   "text": "useful window thirty percent of the time;",
   "start": 127.274,
   "end": 130.884
  },
  {
   "text": "last year's calendar did it sixty",
   "start": 130.884,
   "end": 132.718
  },
  {
   "text": "percent of the time.",
   "start": 132.718,
   "end": 134.831
  },
  {
   "text": "A NASA weather rule lifted the alert",
   "start": 134.831,
   "end": 137.177
  },
  {
   "text": "score from point three eight to",
   "start": 137.177,
   "end": 139.046
  },
  {
   "text": "point four three, but the same rule",
   "start": 139.046,
   "end": 141.948
  },
  {
   "text": "without NASA scored point four nine.",
   "start": 141.948,
   "end": 145.362
  },
  {
   "text": "NASA added nothing here, so we claim nothing.",
   "start": 145.362,
   "end": 149.03
  },
  {
   "text": "Zero unapproved sends, eighty-nine",
   "start": 149.93,
   "end": 152.682
  },
  {
   "text": "of two hundred filtered out by code,",
   "start": 152.682,
   "end": 154.98
  },
  {
   "text": "and one hundred seventeen green tests.",
   "start": 154.98,
   "end": 157.883
  },
  {
   "text": "Open the live PollenPlan demo",
   "start": 157.883,
   "end": 159.787
  },
  {
   "text": "today \u2014 zero setup required.",
   "start": 159.787,
   "end": 162.19
  }
